# ARCH USER REPOSITORY packages. These are AUR code. In upstream Omarchy they
# are delivered as binaries rebuilt in the [omarchy] repo, which hides that they
# are unreviewed AUR code. This fork installs them deliberately, reviewing each
# PKGBUILD first (omarchy-pkg-aur-add -> omarchy-pkg-aur-review).
#
# NOTE: yay is the AUR helper itself and must exist before the others install.
# The installer installs yay first, then prompts to review the rest.

yay
localsend
python-terminaltexteffects
ttf-ia-writer
tzupdate
ufw-docker
yaru-icon-theme
